# The alternative cost "sacrifice a Mountain" needs a permanent with the Mountain subtype (CR 205.3i): on turn 3, with only an
# Island, the cost is not offered (the refusal; Bot2's Llanowar Elves is a legal target); after Bot1 plays Volcanic Island - a
# Mountain by type - the same cast sacrifices it and 5 damage kills the Elves (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Volcanic Island
Mine Collapse
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Mine Collapse.Cast(Llanowar Elves; Ability: Sacrifice)
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mine Collapse.Cast(Llanowar Elves; Ability: Sacrifice)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Graveyard = Mine Collapse; Volcanic Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Island
